{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_226_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_226","textTraditional":"一、十有四年。春，衞公叔戍來奔。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_226_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_226","textTraditional":"二、晉趙陽出奔宋。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_226_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_226","textTraditional":"三、三月辛巳，楚公子結、陳公子佗人帥師滅頓，以頓子牄歸。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_226_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_226","textTraditional":"四、夏，衞北宮結來奔。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_226_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_226","textTraditional":"五、五月，於越敗吳于醉李。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_226_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_226","textTraditional":"六、吳子光卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_226_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_226","textTraditional":"七、公會齊侯、衞侯于堅。公至自會。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_226_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_226","textTraditional":"八、秋，齊侯、宋公會于洮。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_226_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_226","textTraditional":"九、天王使石尚來歸脤。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_226_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_226","textTraditional":"石尚者何？天子之士也。脤者何？俎實也。腥曰脤，孰曰燔。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_226_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_226","textTraditional":"十、衞世子蒯聵出奔宋。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_226_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_226","textTraditional":"十一、衞公孟彄出奔鄭。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_cdt_226_13","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_226","textTraditional":"十二、宋公之弟辰自蕭來奔。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_cdt_226_14","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_226","textTraditional":"十三、大蒐于比蒲。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_cdt_226_15","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_226","textTraditional":"十四、邾婁子來會公。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_cdt_226_16","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_226","textTraditional":"十五、城莒父及霄。","sentenceOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}